Z||000009||2xsess||11-20-2001||11:03 PM||||Thank you everyone.<P>Yes, just in time for a tax break.lol. My wife was determined that it be that way but I think delivering 5 1/2 weeks early was going a little overboard <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Actually Jim the rest of my unit isn't leaving Kosovo until tomorrow, I just got lucky that they sent me home a week early. There were some guys over there that weren't so lucky. ||||reg||1
